{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_20\">Problem 20</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 20\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/8/76835fe93cb572c94d8c81dfee3b04313bceec62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{25-t^2}+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" /> equals zero for: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b6d73fc471b9212ed0a5998c868aaa539b1b121.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{no real or imaginary values of }t\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{no real values of }t\\text{ only}\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{no imaginary values of }t\\text{ only}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ t=0\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ t=\\pm 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"497\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can make the following equation:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/5/8153c29136d38236cf8f00708e9872fe76bbebbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{25-t^2}+5 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />, which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/8/7b8b289cfec2dcce1cafffc75b7ac639815a396c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{25-t^2} = -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" /> Square both sides, and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c672a0f62da98c3d14534a1e7c0027258dfcdd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 - t^2 = 25$\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />, which would mean that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/288e2a39b58d673182c57dc6214b702a448341ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 0$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />, but that is an extraneous solution and doesn't work in the original equation.\n</p><p>Therefore, the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Note: When talking about square roots, it generally means the positive square root, or the \"principal root.\"\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align